[{"answer":"Good morning. I've been looking at your holidays to Australia in your brochure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm thinking of going during the second half of next month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Good morning. As you can see from our brochure,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/3.mp3"},{"answer":"we offer a wide variety of packages to various destinations in Australia.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything in particular that interests you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, my husband and I are very interested in the holidays in the Outback.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/6.mp3"},{"answer":"These holidays are becoming increasingly popular.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like to arrange flights and accommodation with us, or just accommodation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you arrange flights from Sydney?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/10.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, flights and accommodation then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. You said that you wanted to travel next month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Which date would you prefer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I should point out that there are no daily flights available,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/14.mp3"},{"answer":"so if you have a flexible itinerary, that's better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we arrive in Sydney on the 15th of April","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and we were thinking of travelling to the Outback on the 18th of August, er... I mean April.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/17.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. There's only one flight from Sydney to Alice Springs on the 18th, so I'll book you on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It leaves at 10 in the morning, which is quite convenient.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall I book two seats for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/21.mp3"},{"answer":"As for your stay in the Outback,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/22.mp3"},{"answer":"you can see from the brochure that we offer three packages:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/23.mp3"},{"answer":"budget, standard, and luxury.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The budget package is about 500 Australian dollars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/25.mp3"},{"answer":"The standard package is about 700 and the luxury one is approximately 1,000,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/26.mp3"},{"answer":"though it does depend on exactly what you would like regarding extras.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Which one would you prefer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we can't decide between the budget and standard options.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, well, actually, just looking at my computer here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/30.mp3"},{"answer":"on the date that you want to fly into Alice Springs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/31.mp3"},{"answer":"there is no standard accommodation available. It's fully booked, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/32.mp3"},{"answer":"That's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/33.mp3"},{"answer":"We think that the cheapest one should be fine for us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/34.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't mind roughing it for a few days and we don't expect to be spending much time at our accommodations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/35.mp3"},{"answer":"We prefer the outdoors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Let's look at the room options.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/37.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, would you prefer a non-smoking room?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Neither of us smokes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/39.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, before I forget,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/41.mp3"},{"answer":"could you book everything in my husband's name, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course. Are you paying by credit card?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/44.mp3"},{"answer":"In that case, I'll need your husband's name exactly as it appears on the card.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course. It's John A. Smyth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/46.mp3"},{"answer":"That's Smyth with a \"Y\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/47.mp3"},{"answer":"John... middle initial \"A\"...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/48.mp3"},{"answer":"surname Smyth, S-M-Y-T-H.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that correct?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Correct.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you. I'll just check the price.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/52.mp3"},{"answer":"The room will cost $100 a night plus $10 tax,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/53.mp3"},{"answer":"so $110 per night in total.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/54-2019-04-13-04-48-25.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that OK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's fine. Book us for three nights, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Most of the guests like to participate in some special activities and trips while they're staying in the Outback.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything that interests you and your husband?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there are several things we'd like to see and do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/59.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd definitely like to visit the Cultural Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's very popular.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It's within walking distance of the accommodation and it's free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/62-2019-04-13-04-50-19.mp3"},{"answer":"It's also a great place to pick up souvenirs of your trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/63.mp3"},{"answer":"We were thinking about visiting one of the nearby farms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/64.mp3"},{"answer":"There are two farms nearby - a sheep farm and a kangaroo farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/65.mp3"},{"answer":"There is also an opportunity to ride camels in the desert.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you ridden a camel before?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/67.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but it sounds like fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you give me some more details about the kangaroo farm and the camel ride?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/70.mp3"},{"answer":"The kangaroo farm includes information on how the animals are raised","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/71.mp3"},{"answer":"whilst the camel ride provides information on desert flora and fauna.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Which would you prefer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/73.mp3"},{"answer":"You can arrange to see the kangaroos in the wild if you like, rather than on a farm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/74.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/75.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, we'll go on the camel ride and see the kangaroos in their natural habitat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/76.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. I'll arrange that for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I forgot to mention that the journey also includes a stop at a place of aboriginal artwork.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/78.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a place well-known for its stone carvings of animals and mythical creatures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/79.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Are the carvings in the desert?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Wonderful!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's perfect then. I'm sure you'll have a lovely trip,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/84.mp3"},{"answer":"but remember that you need to take care in the sun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. We're really looking forward to our trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/86.mp3"},{"answer":"We really want to try to experience the Dreamtime under the stars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course. That's what a trip to the Outback is really all about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, how about the cost...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-5-2019-03-18-14-55-09/90.mp3"}]
